  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole organism, not isolated skull or generic renamed pterosaur. [\"Wing membrane outline, soft tissue and colour inferred; neutral gliding pose is artistic.\", \"Juvenile skeleton provides topology, not adult body proportions. Adult scale comes from museum account.\", \"Stylized tooth count is deliberately reduced for performance, not claimed exact fossil count.\"] {\"wingspan_m\": 2.4, \"basis\": \"AMNH approximate 8-foot wingspan, adult artistic target, not juvenile MIC-V241 measured scale.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole organism, not isolated skull or generic renamed pterosaur. [\"Wing membrane outline, soft tissue and colour inferred; neutral gliding pose is artistic.\", \"Juvenile skeleton provides topology, not adult body proportions. Adult scale comes from museum account.\", \"Stylized tooth count is deliberately reduced for performance, not claimed exact fossil count.\"] {\"wingspan_m\": 2.4, \"basis\": \"AMNH approximate 8-foot wingspan, adult artistic target, not juvenile MIC-V241 measured scale.\"}"
  },
